cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ExoIris in your research, please cite the paper
  listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "ExoIris: Fast Exoplanet Transmission Spectroscopy in Python"
abstract: >-
  ExoIris is a Python package for exoplanet transmission spectroscopy
  that models the full 2D spectroscopic transit time series directly,
  supporting joint multi-instrument, multi-epoch analyses.
authors:
